<title>NETHERLANDS: KOPPELPOORT HALVES H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KOPPELPOORT HALVES H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 0.52 vs   1.05</p>
<p>    Turnover				34.1  vs  38.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.56 vs   0.94</p>
<p>Note - Capital goods trader Koppelpoort Holding NV said it</p>
<p>expected 1996 full-year results to lag behind those of 1995 in</p>
<p>view of developments in the first 1996 half and the difficult</p>
<p>market conditions.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
